From 6adb67738e3af6dbcfe87fed2b7dbe5c0cc9d3c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 02:27:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH v4 23/27] rust: drm: kms: add the plane rotation property

Rotation represents only the combinations the DRM rotation property
accepts, so a driver cannot ask for one the core will reject, and
create_rotation_property() attaches it to a plane under construction.
The plane state's rotation() reads back what userspace asked for.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
Signed-off-by: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
---
